    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d163">

                <pb facs="0185" n="176" sameAs="frus:frus1938v05/pg176"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.34119/1694: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Argentina</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Tuck</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1938-11-23T17:00:00-05:00">November 23, 1938—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>174. For Haden. Your 311, November 22, 4 p.m. You are authorized to sign on
                    behalf of the delegation of the United States the act constituting the Mixed
                        Commission.<anchor n="60" xml:id="d163-f1"/> The Department, however, is <pb
                        facs="0186" n="177" xml:id="pg177"/> of the opinion that Article III as
                    drafted is obscure and that it should be revised along the following lines:
                        <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“Should differences of opinion arise between the representatives of the
                            two parties on the Mixed Commission with respect to technical and
                            practical questions involved in the application on the ground of the
                            dividing line traced by the arbitral award, the decision of the
                            President of the Mixed Commission shall resolve definitively all such
                            questions.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d163-f1" n="60" xml:id="d163-f1-content">
                <p>For text of Act of Constitution of the Mixed Commission, see <hi
                        rendition="#italic">The Chaco Peace Conference</hi>, p. 177. For subsequent
                    acts, see <hi rendition="#italic">ibid</hi>., pp. 179 ff.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
